#: ../userguides/buildings_aerial_imagery_model.rst:2
#: ad21c33066004295ad152b5cdd754420
msgid "🏠⭐️ Buildings (Aerial) (CUSTOM)"
msgstr "🏠⭐️ Edificios (Aéreo) (PERSONALIZADO)"

#: ../userguides/buildings_aerial_imagery_model.rst:4
#: c783e23a4e5c4490814f30bb65aaf58d
msgid ""
"This model has been deprecated as default one and moved to custom as its "
"geodomain application is limited. it's available by request."
msgstr ""
"Este modelo ha quedado obsoleto como modelo predeterminado y se ha movido a "
"personalizado ya que su aplicación de geodominio es limitada. está "
"disponible a pedido."

#: ../userguides/buildings_aerial_imagery_model.rst:7
#: dd83c14a064241b08bd34dfec0aaa3ca
msgid ""
"This model is specifically designed to be used on a high resolution aerial "
"imagery (15-10cm per pixel) for extraction of small buildings and detailed "
"structure outlines. It is best suited for rural and suburban residential "
"areas. We do not recommend using this model in areas with high-dense urban "
"buildings. Use :doc:`Buildings model <buildings_model>` instead, even for "
"aerial imagery."
msgstr ""
"Este modelo está diseñado específicamente para usarse en imágenes aéreas de "
"alta resolución (15-10 cm por píxel) para la extracción de edificios "
"pequeños y contornos estructurales detallados. Es más adecuado para zonas "
"residenciales rurales y suburbanas. No recomendamos utilizar este modelo en "
"zonas con edificaciones urbanas de alta densidad. Utilice :doc:`Buildings "
"model <buildings_model>` en su lugar, incluso para imágenes aéreas."

